    },
    {
      "id": "87cc1393dc5e46f8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20739,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$\\delta$函数（Dirac Delta函数）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f75714436ec44dfc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$g(x)$ 是单调递减函数**"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d6300e5ceb4ef4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$g(x)$ 是单调递增函数**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f51f2ee39a0f425b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$n$ 次**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3fb16965ae0a4bd7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$N(t)$ 与 $S_n$ 的关系**"
    },
    {
      "id": "63ca8762823043db",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$P^n$ 的各行都会收敛到同一个向量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb4c5a293fa34efd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$p_{ij}$渐进性质,平稳分布,吸收链**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c57dd97a499415b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**$W_n$ 的分布**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d44aebb732b4379",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1) 二维随机变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0af11b907c6b40e8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1)$(Ω, F, P)$是概率空间**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5c5b344d4084081",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1)$n$维随机变量定义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b28997b5e164ac1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1). $\\delta$函数的定义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "009cb6d3ad39420e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1). 问题背景**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc8bbe47c7b845ba",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(1)离散型随机变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "16c95708f7324019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2) 独立随机变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a77e04325de540ee",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2)$X=X(e)$是定义在$Ω$上的实函数**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3fa2149af569498c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -20079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2). $\\delta$函数的性质**"
    },
    {
      "id": "58b476c32980422c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -20079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2). 单调函数变换**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c9de839c7234ca2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -20079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2). 联合分布函数**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae12554f79d54469",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(2)连续型随机变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e49a38a12dac4b5c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(3). 如果对任意实数$x$，$\\{e:X(e) \\leq x\\} \\in F$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b08e23366424add",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(3). 离散型随机变量的概率密度表示**"
    },
    {
      "id": "32a801aec1ea4d41",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(3). 非单调函数变换**"
    },
    {
      "id": "85b9d8558d4a4d5d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(3)常见分布**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a0599c557f5495f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(4). 举例**"
    },
    {
      "id": "017fcb2fa36344e6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(4). 例子：$Y = \\cos(X)$ 的概率密度**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f076ca8bf8ff448f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(4)则称$X(e)$是$F$上的随机变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "25581260afae44e4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**(5)$\\delta$函数的意义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a6b6cbfbec04ae6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**) 连续型随机变量的性质**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7620b1193a041fd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(1). $\\delta$函数的定义****"
    },
    {
      "id": "417c5271b1f34cb6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(1). 问题背景****"
    },
    {
      "id": "630eb98665c14c79",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(2). 单调函数变换****"
    },
    {
      "id": "09fc239a3e1946d0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(2). 联合分布函数****"
    },
    {
      "id": "10af38f7470b405b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(3). 离散型随机变量的概率密度表示****"
    },
    {
      "id": "82919fbabc2a471d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(3). 非单调函数变换****"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8819e3b1b204565",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(4). 举例****"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdf928119b4a44a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****(4). 例子：$Y = \\cos(X)$ 的概率密度****"
    },
    {
      "id": "b98222af8ce34fe3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1) $g(x)$ 是单调递增函数****"
    },
    {
      "id": "f33f3b57cf5943c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1) 若一个 $y$ 对应两个 $x$ 值 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$****"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d9871045ae94ba8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1).离散型随机变量定义****"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec21839973ab459e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1).连续型随机变量定义****"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c6d6047eef14a96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1.1. 泊松过程的定义****"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c7b72073b3a47f4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -19199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1.1.1 定义1（基于独立增量和泊松分布）****"
    },
    {
      "id": "921191163f1b4c7f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -19089,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1.1.2 定义2（基于指数分布的到达间隔）****"
    },
    {
      "id": "c528c850a66e4bb5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -19089,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "****1.2 一步转移概率**：**"
